    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Here is what nobody tells you about first impressions: the scent you wear does more cognitive work in the first three seconds than your shoes, your jacket, or the opening line you practiced in the mirror.</p><p>Olfactory memory is hardwired directly into the brain's emotional center. But first dates are also a minefield for fragrance. Wear too little, and you leave no trace; wear too much, and your date is gasping for air across the table.</p>"
      }
    },
