    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>The golden rule of first date fragrance is simple: your scent should never announce you from across the pub or restaurant; it should reward them for leaning in. You want an intimate scent bubble—roughly arm's length—that feels effortless, alluring, and completely natural.</p><p>Whether you are dressing for a casual pint or a candlelit dinner, here are the masterfully balanced scents that set the right mood from the very first greeting.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_614820f",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Understated Elegance vs Intoxicating Confidence",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p><strong>Timeless Grace</strong> (inspired by Coco Mademoiselle by Chanel) is the definition of effortless romantic confidence. It does not try too hard because it does not need to.</p><p>The opening sparkles with orange and bergamot, transitioning into a delicate heart of morning rose and jasmine, anchored by clean white musk and patchouli. It signals sophistication, warmth, and impeccable taste.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p><strong>Pink Whisper</strong> (inspired by Delina by Parfums de Marly) leans into intoxicating, modern femininity. The signature Turkish rose note is accented by crisp lychee, rhubarb, and warm cashmere wood.</p><p>It has an irresistible, velvet-smooth sweetness that lingers in the air when you walk past, making it one of the most complimented date night fragrances in our catalog.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG"
