    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>For Men: Marine vs Invictor</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>For men, the biggest mistake on a date is reaching for an aggressive, room-clearing club scent. What works on a date is clean magnetism—the impression that you naturally smell incredible without having drowned yourself in cologne.</p><p><strong>Marine</strong> (inspired by Bleu de Chanel) is virtually impossible to get wrong. Crisp grapefruit and mint open into aromatic cedar, vetiver, and incense. It is clean, grounded, and universally attractive.</p><p>If you prefer a bolder, fruit-and-smoke profile with undeniable presence, <strong>Invictor</strong> (inspired by Aventus by Creed) pairs smoky birch and rich oakmoss with fresh blackcurrant and bergamot.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>The 3-spray date rule</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>Keep application restrained: one spray behind each ear on the neck, and one spray on the center of your chest or collar. This creates an aura of warmth that rises as you talk, without projecting an overpowering cloud across the table.</p><p>Apply twenty to thirty minutes before you arrive so the initial alcohol settles into the seductive heart notes.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
